Description: Provides lightweight tools to normalize miRNA-seq count matrices
    using reads per million (RPM), filter miRNAs by abundance and prevalence,
    perform nonparametric group comparisons with multiple-testing correction,
    and generate static and interactive expression plots.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
